 "remarks": "Sophisticated urban living in the heart of SoNo. This stunning 2 bedroom condo is as stylish as it is functional, featuring a bright, open layout designed for effortless modern living. Extensive recent updates throughout the unit deliver a truly turnkey experience. Simply move in and enjoy. Thoughtfully maintained and move-in ready, the home offers exceptional quality and peace of mind from day one. All of this, just steps from Metro-North, the waterfront, and Norwalk's best dining, shopping, and nightlife. With easy access to I-95, Route 7, and the Merritt Parkway for the ultimate commuter lifestyle. Whether you're downsizing in style or planting roots in one of Fairfield County's most vibrant neighborhoods, this is a rare opportunity not to be missed. Walk to everything. Commute with ease. Live beautifully.",
